PUBLISHED CMS API
Default base URL:
https://payload-cms-poc-seven.vercel.app
Interactive API documentation:
https://payload-cms-poc-seven.vercel.app/api/docs
OpenAPI 3.1 contract:
https://payload-cms-poc-seven.vercel.app/api/openapi.json
Public content API:
https://payload-cms-poc-seven.vercel.app/api/content/v1
The mobile content contract version is 1.1; public operations require no authentication.

Relevant operations:
GET /api/content/v1/bootstrap
GET /api/content/v1/pages/home
GET /api/content/v1/pages/menu
GET /api/content/v1/legal/privacy_policy
GET /api/media/file/{filename}
POST /api/form-submissions

Responses use a versioned envelope containing contractVersion, data, and optional metadata.